{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026s1a0OC3Vp91793577890.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國佛羅里達州發生墜機事故，機上9人全部喪生。</p><p></p><p>事發於當地星期日下午1時左右，涉事商用中型噴射機從得州飛往巴哈馬途中失事。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GscGwM3amC1793577907.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有行車記錄儀拍攝到該飛機急墜，撞落一條主要公路附近後爆炸，燃起巨大火球，暫時未知地面有沒有人傷亡。當局正調查事故原因。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0800.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uhMX6CCq4B1793577930.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.308734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.905739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:37.108340+00:00","content_hash":"c2a2507aa7ef6bbf01efdf5c3c1823c6c2c3a2e6ca01d3a4834333467d662795","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.308734+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}